        {{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We identify the leading term of the polynomial and compute its limit:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\,\\infty }(4-{x}^{2}) & ={lim}_{x\\to \\,\\infty }(-{x}^{2}) \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to \\,\\infty }({x}^{2}) \\\\  & =-(\\infty ) \\\\  & =-\\infty \\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-166216/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "fc04f720-28f3-55ab-8e89-582db57672a4"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-166216"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-166222/field-1/85c717abcd6554d758233f37f58654e3f11dc83bbfc6edfd633af2cfbbc899f5" :answer/id #uuid "d8cff3fd-3773-555e-9f9f-e31462ceb14b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4.25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-166222/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "3db12b72-7f80-5853-af4b-34f8489452e5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-166222/field-1/85c717abcd6554d758233f37f58654e3f11dc83bbfc6edfd633af2cfbbc899f5" :answer-field/choices ["q-166222/field-1/85c717abcd6554d758233f37f58654e3f11dc83bbfc6edfd633af2cfbbc899f5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-166222" :question/id #uuid "0372052e-053c-559a-b9eb-2075e647da29" :question/math-academy-id "q-166222" :question/problem "Consider the quadratic function $f(x)=4-{x}^{2}.$\n\nEarlier part 1:\n\nFind ${lim}_{x\\to \\,\\infty }f(x).$ If the limit does not exist, write \"DNE\" (without the quotation marks).\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                          