ield-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We first apply the sum rule, and then apply the constant rule and compute the limits of the power functions:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{h\\to \\,0}(-2x-h) & ={lim}_{h\\to \\,0}(-2x)-{lim}_{h\\to \\,0}h \\\\  & =-2x{lim}_{h\\to \\,0}1-{lim}_{h\\to \\,0}h \\\\  & =-2x-0 \\\\  & =-2x\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-166221/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "dad9bdc2-a243-5437-8904-9906c2d9a90e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-166221"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
